rted “strange ...</p><a href=\"https://www.autosport.com/f1/news/hamilton-set-for-new-penalty-will-start-f1-brazilian-gp-from-back-of-grid/10872645/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk\">Keep reading</a>","contentLength":408,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-4.motorsport.com/images/amp/0qgKrwgY/s6/lewis-hamilton-ferrari-2.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"MotoGP Qatar GP: Marquez wins thrilling sprint after Bezzecchi clash, Martin fights to third","url":"https://www.autosport.com/motogp/news/motogp-qatar-grand-prix-marc-marquez-wins-thrilling-sprint-as-jorge-martin-fights-to-third/10872619/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&utm_term=News&utm_content=uk","date":1794070409,"author":"","guid":497,"unread":true,"content":"Marc Marquez emerged victorious from a MotoGP sprint race in Qatar after a controversial clash with Marco Bezzecchi which took the Italian out of the title fight.Jorge Martin put in a spectacular effort to ride to third place despite a broken wrist, but could not prevent Marquez from lining up a shot at sealing the crown on Sunday.<p>The factory Ducati rider will need to win the Qatar GP on ...</p><a href=\"https://www.autosport.com/motogp/news/motogp-qatar-grand-prix-marc-marquez-wins-thrilling-sprint-as-jorge-martin-fights-to-third/10872619/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk\">Keep reading</a>","contentLength":406,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-8.motorsport.com/images/amp/27No3Qv0/s6/marc-marquez-ducati-team.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"F1 Brazilian GP: Verstappen edges out Antonelli to top FP3 as Hamilton hits mechanical trouble","url":"https://www.autosport.com/f1/news/f1-brazilian-gp-verstappen-edges-out-antonelli-to-top-fp3-as-hamilton-hits-mechanical-trouble/10872582/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&utm_term=N